            "review_text": "SydneyVietman\nSydney61 contributions\n0\nFabulous restaurant right on My An beach\nJul 2015 • Couples\nI've been here before a couple of years back. It was overpriced then but now it has been refurbished (not as nice as before) they have changed the menu to mostly seafood dishes and at very reasonable prices. We chose our fresh seafood from the tanks,also choosing, with staff help, the cooking method. \nIt is a wonderful location looking out over the floodlit beach. We dined on the deck but you can dine on the beach as well. Very romantic for a couple, great too for a group party.\nRead more\nWritten July 22, 2015",
