            "review_title": "Review at Danabeach",
            "review_text": "Linnéa L\nStockholm, Sweden2 contributions\n0\nNice place to spend a day on the beach\nJul 2014 • Couples\nThis place is right on My Khe beach, we rented beach chairs (50000 VND each) for the day - had some drinks on the beach and then grabbed a table for dinner at sunset. \n\nThe food was tasty, a little expensive but big portions made up for it (I bet a lot of the dishes can be shared). Ordering was a little confusing as there seem to be multiple menus and there was a language barrier as we don't speak vietnamese - but the staff was very friendly and we got it sorted out in the end. \n\nRecommended for a nice day on the beach!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 12, 2014",
